  "details": "I would like to contact you to confirm something about the event at VRChat.\n\nIf this is the wrong place to contact us, we apologize.\n\nIf so, please let us know the exact location of your inquiry.\n\nI have already asked VRChat about this subject via \"Send a request\" and \"hello@vrchat.com\". \n\nBut since I haven't received a reply in 3 days, I would like to ask a question here as well.\n\nOn the account VRC Matchmaking (@vr_matching) The following announcement has been issued.\nVRChat, Inc. has given us permission to have a paid matchmaking session on VRChat on June 8.\n\nThe exact wording of the announcement is that \"only male users are allowed to pay\".\n\nIs this information true?\n\nThe act of \"taking money from users\" as a sanctioned event isoriginally prohibited by the Terms of Use.\n\nIf this information is true I would like to attend the event.\n\nHowever, we cannot confirm from \"VRC Matchmaking\" that they have received permission from VRChat to conduct paid matchmaking sessions.\n\nTherefore, can you please confirm this with the management?\n\nI am attaching the URL of the information so that you can confirm whether the information that \"VRChat has given us permission to take money from users\" is true or not.\n\nWe would appreciate it if you could confirm if this information is true.\n\nhttps://note.com/kouch_vr/n/n319f34e53d4b",
